  "claim": "WM-XCT-036 is a format- and interface-neutral, host-scoped mixin for governed alias, mapping, explicit not-same and same-as assertions between externally owned identifiers or records. It preserves relation strength, authority, evidence, confidence, context, time, lifecycle and projection loss; it reports paths, clusters and operational impacts without owning endpoints, matching, reasoning, master-data merge, redirect execution, authorization, audit storage, notification delivery or physical deletion.",
